//! Text advance widths measured from the real fonts with CoreText.
//!
//! The badge SVGs pin every measured string with textLength, the same trick
//! shields.io uses, so clients that substitute DejaVu or another fallback
//! still lay the badge out with identical geometry. Verdana carries the pill,
//! Helvetica Bold places the card's velocity text after the star count.
//! Whole-string widths equal the summed advances plus the kern adjustments
//! for adjacent pairs; the golden tests hold the renderer to the reference
//! SVGs, so a drifted table fails loudly.
//!
//! Generated file, do not edit: regenerate with the measurement tooling
//! (macOS, CoreText) if the badge ever needs characters outside these sets.

